<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FENCING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FENCING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the world fencing championships on Friday:</p>
<p>Men's team foil semifinals</p>
<p>Cuba beat Italy 45-32</p>
<p>France beat Germany 45-36</p>
<p>Third place playoff</p>
<p>Italy beat Germany 45-39</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>France beat Cuba 45-43</p>
<p>Women's team foil semifinals</p>
<p>Italy beat France 45-23</p>
<p>Romania beat Germany 45-22</p>
<p>Third place playoff</p>
<p>Germany beat France 45-27</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Italy beat Romania 45-36</p>
</text>
